{"resourceIdentifier":"4095","resourceName":"Rio Manito Grouped REDD Project","description":"The Rio Manito Grouped REDD Project is located in the Marcelandia municipality, in the State of Mato Grosso. The project area are seven private instances consisting of 100% Amazon rainforest. The present REDD project is expected to avoid predicted 4,915 ha of deforestation equating to 3,083,553 tCO2e in emissions reductions over the 30-year project lifetime, with an annual average of 102,785 tCO2e.\r\n\r\nIn addition to the project’s ecological and carbon benefits, a proportion of the carbon credits generated will be dedicated to improving the social and environmental conditions in the project region, specifically contributing to improving deforestation control, aiming at the propagation of environmental awareness, generation of alternative sources of income and environmental education actions.","location":{"latitude":-10.478186,"longitude":-54.244377},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-01-20","endExclusive":"2023-02-20","endInclusive":"2023-02-19"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4095"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Mato Grosso"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Future Carbon Holding S.A."},{"type":"string","value":"São Paulo, Brazil"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"102785"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"REDD"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0015"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"13616 Hectares"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VCS Validation/Verification Body"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/12/2022 - 30/11/2052"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=82751&IDKEY=niquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkf8114113629","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS PD_RioManito_REDDProject_Draft.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-01-13T17:59:33.347Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=82971&IDKEY=lkjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj9094114417009","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Listing Representation - Rio Manito (2).pdf","uploadDate":"2023-01-17T16:35:07.343Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_ISSUANCE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Issuance Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_OTHER_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Other Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=82726&IDKEY=f903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdff114079154","documentType":"KML File","documentName":"ARL_Draft_RioManito.kml","uploadDate":"2023-01-13T14:58:34.137Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=106260&IDKEY=4iquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfn146532540","documentType":"Public Commentary","documentName":"Public_Comments_Summary_ID_4095_.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-01-22T06:15:46.287Z"}]}],"childResources":[]}